1
00:00:00,040 --> 00:00:03,040
Seperti pengantin pada hari perkahwinan.

2
00:00:05,040 --> 00:00:07,261
Maksudnya sibuk, tahu tak?

3
00:00:07,261 --> 00:00:08,560
Pengantin hari kahwin macam mana?

4
00:00:08,560 --> 00:00:09,040
Sibuk.

5
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:11,490
Orang zaman sekarang sibuk dengan

6
00:00:11,490 --> 00:00:12,343
makeup lah, apa lah.

7
00:00:12,343 --> 00:00:14,230
Orang dulu sibuk nak melawan,

8
00:00:14,230 --> 00:00:16,040
melayan orang datang.

9
00:00:16,040 --> 00:00:17,240
Sibuk.

10
00:00:18,040 --> 00:00:21,800
Tapi biasanya, perkahwinan ini tak

11
00:00:21,800 --> 00:00:23,040
berlaku selalu.

12
00:00:23,480 --> 00:00:24,680
Eh?

13
00:00:25,040 --> 00:00:27,590
Sepanjang hayat mungkin sekali, dua

14
00:00:27,590 --> 00:00:29,040
kali, tiga kali.

15
00:00:29,040 --> 00:00:30,900
Itulah bandingannya.

16
00:00:31,040 --> 00:00:32,240
Maksudnya,

17
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:35,897
tak bolehlah selalu jamak ni.

18
00:00:35,897 --> 00:00:38,680
Bila sibuk sangat,

19
00:00:39,220 --> 00:00:41,040
baru boleh jamak.

20
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:47,040
Hadis ini diamalkan oleh orang Syiah.

21
00:00:47,040 --> 00:00:49,040
Dia jamak selalu.

22
00:00:49,040 --> 00:00:51,040
Hari-hari jamak.

23
00:00:53,200 --> 00:00:55,040
Memang akhir zaman ni sibuk selalu,

24
00:00:55,040 --> 00:00:57,040
masyaqqah selalu.

25
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:59,040
Itu fahaman dia.

26
00:00:59,040 --> 00:01:01,480
Kita boleh amalkan hadis ini bila

27
00:01:01,480 --> 00:01:03,040
kita terlalu sibuk.

28
00:01:12,040 --> 00:01:14,260
Orang Parit ni tak rasa jem,

29
00:01:14,260 --> 00:01:15,040
tak tahu.

30
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:20,040
Saya pernah, daripada Bangi,

31
00:01:20,040 --> 00:01:23,680
pensyarah saya ajak buka puasa di Keramat.

32
00:01:24,040 --> 00:01:26,010
Lepas Asar

33
00:01:26,780 --> 00:01:27,860
tu, saya start.

34
00:01:27,860 --> 00:01:31,950
Pukul 5, sampai pukul 7, elok-elok bukalah.

35
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:34,040
Sampai di Keramat tahu berapa?

36
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,840
Pukul 8.45.

37
00:01:36,040 --> 00:01:38,590
Saya punya pensyarah dah start nak

38
00:01:38,590 --> 00:01:40,040
pergi sembahyang terawih.

39
00:01:40,040 --> 00:01:44,040
Jadi macam mana dengan Maghrib saya tadi?

40
00:01:50,470 --> 00:01:51,821
Ini masyaqqah.

41
00:01:51,821 --> 00:01:54,920
Masyaqqah ni boleh jamak.
